\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8WeakSquareCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8WeakSquareCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Limit}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Limit}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Club}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Club}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (club-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ot}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{ot}:V\\to V\\)</span> (order-type operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}weak\\text{-}square\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8WeakSquareCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal C,\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa^+:\\mathrm{Limit}(\\alpha)\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal C))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|\\mathcal C_\\alpha|\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C_\\alpha\\;(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{ot}(C)\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\beta\\in C\\;(\\mathrm{Limit}(\\beta)\\to C\\cap\\beta\\in\\mathcal C_\\beta))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}weak\\text{-}square\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8WeakSquareCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal C,\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa^+:\\mathrm{Limit}(\\alpha)\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal C))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|\\mathcal C_\\alpha|\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C_\\alpha\\;(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{ot}(C)\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\beta\\in C\\;(\\mathrm{Limit}(\\beta)\\to C\\cap\\beta\\in\\mathcal C_\\beta))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square^*_{\\kappa}=\\square_{\\kappa,\\kappa}\">\\(\\square^*_{\\kappa}=\\square_{\\kappa,\\kappa}\\)</span>: the width is at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, every club has order type at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, and coherence holds at limit points.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batc